{"title":"Karims Schatz","puid":"c-natdeu-3/c4k4kk","path":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/block-03-lesen-ausmalen/level-03","type":"normal","voiceLang":"de","voice":"m3_2025","instruction":{"voice":"f5_2025"},"trainers":[{"trainer":"kidColorize","finishButton":true,"finishSound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>door_opening01</voice>","textAlign":"left","lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/block-03-lesen-ausmalen/lsg/03_Kinderzimmer1-copy.lsg","width":350},"instruction":{"text":"Lies und male aus.","speaker":true},"colors":{"yellow":"rgba(255,224,130,1)","indigo":"rgba(123,31,162,1)","green":"rgba(56,142,60,1)"},"atoms":{"a":"Willst du wissen, wie es bei Karim zu Hause aussieht? <br>Sein Flur ist lang und hat gelbe Wände, wie eine Packung Zitronenbonbons – knallig und fröhlich. Rechts: eine lila Tür. Da wohnt Karims großer Bruder. Besser nicht stören! Links: eine grüne Tür. Die gehört Karim.","tasks":[{"class":"Wand","color":"yellow","total":3},{"class":"Karim","color":"green","total":1},{"class":"Bruder","color":"indigo","total":1}]}},{"trainer":"kidColorize","finishButton":true,"finishSound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>curtains_open</voice>","textAlign":"left","lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/block-03-lesen-ausmalen/lsg/03_Kinderzimmer2.lsg","width":350},"instruction":{"text":"Lies und male aus.","speaker":true},"colors":{"green":"rgba(165,214,167,1)","orange":"rgba(255,167,38,1)"},"atoms":{"a":"Kein Wunder, dass auch sein Zimmer grün gestrichen ist – das ist nämlich seine absolute Lieblingsfarbe.<br>Wenn er morgens die orangen Vorhänge aufzieht, sieht er Hügel, ein kleines Dorf und Kühe, die manchmal so gucken, als wüssten sie irgendwas Spannendes.","tasks":[{"class":"Wand","color":"green","total":2},{"class":"Vorhang","color":"orange","total":2}]}},{"trainer":"kidColorize","finishButton":true,"finishSound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>rolling_wooden_ball</voice>","textAlign":"left","lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/block-03-lesen-ausmalen/lsg/03_Kinderzimmer3.lsg","width":350},"instruction":{"text":"Lies und male aus.","speaker":true},"colors":{"blue":"rgba(66,165,245,1)","indigo":"rgba(206,147,216,1)","yellow":"rgba(255,224,130,1)","red":"rgba(244,67,54,1)"},"atoms":{"a":"In seinem lila Schrank hängen Klamotten – und irgendwo ganz hinten versteckt sich sein Superhelden-T-Shirt. Nach der Schule landet er direkt auf seinem Teppich mit zwei gelben und zwei blauen Kreisen – der perfekte Ort zum Zocken. <br>Und unter dem Bett? Da wartet eine leuchtend rote Kiste – Karims geheimer Schatz.","tasks":[{"class":"Teppich","color":"blue","total":2},{"class":"Teppich","color":"yellow","total":2},{"class":"Schrank","color":"indigo","total":1},{"class":"Box","color":"red","total":1}]}},{"trainer":"kidColorize","finishButton":true,"finishSound":"<voice voiceLang='de' voice='custom'>chimes_magical</voice>","textAlign":"left","lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/block-03-lesen-ausmalen/lsg/03_Kinderzimmer4-copy.lsg","width":350},"instruction":{"text":"Lies und male aus.","speaker":true},"colors":{"orange":"rgba(239,108,0,1)","blue":"rgba(13,71,161,1)","green":"rgba(76,175,80,1)","cyan":"rgba(0,172,193,1)"},"atoms":{"a":" In der Schatzkiste liegen seine Superheldenfigur mit dem orangen Umhang, eine dunkelblaue Tischtenniskelle, grüne Glückswürfel und ein türkiser Edelstein, der neulich ganz kurz aufgeleuchtet hat. Ob da Magie im Spiel ist?","tasks":[{"class":"Figur","color":"orange","total":1},{"class":"Tischtennis","color":"blue","total":1},{"class":"Würfel","color":"green","total":2},{"class":"Edelstein","color":"cyan","total":1}]}}],"parentTopic":{"title":"Lesen – Genau lesen","path":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-15-lesen-woerter-saetze-genau-lesen/topic","puid":"c-natdeu-3/5dgag3"},"parentBlock":{"title":"Lesen und Ausmalen","path":"/../c-natdeu-3/topic-